       "pure": true,
       "help": "The last device used wins: desktop (mouse and keys) or touch, with pad-input on top. A mouse does not switch a device whose primary pointer is coarse; a key always does.",
       "inputs": [
        {
         "name": "event",
         "type": "enum",
         "of": "DeviceEvent",
         "value": 3
        },
        {
         "name": "fine",
         "type": "bool",
         "value": true
        },
        {
         "name": "coarse",
         "type": "bool",
         "value": false
        },
        {
         "name": "desktop",
         "type": "bool",
         "value": true
        },
        {
         "name": "pad",
         "type": "bool",
         "value": false
        }
       ],
       "outputs": [
        {
         "name": "desktop",
         "type": "bool",
         "value": true
        },
        {
         "name": "pad",
         "type": "bool",
         "value": false
        }
       ]
      },
      {
       "name": "HintLine",
       "pure": true,
       "help": "The key help of a mode (\"foot\", \"drone\", \"car\", \"jet\"), with the weapon in front where the mode has weapons; the respawn line while dead",
       "inputs": [
        {
         "name": "mode",
         "type": "text",
         "value": ""
        },
        {
         "name": "weapon",
         "type": "text",
         "value": ""
        },
        {
         "name": "dead",
         "type": "bool",
         "value": false
        }
       ],
       "outputs": [
        {
         "name": "line",
         "type": "text",
         "value": ""
        }
       ]
      }
     ]
    }
   }
  },
