       "name": "StateController_kinematic_vertical_speed",
       "pure": true,
       "help": "min(linear, braking curve): the braking curve v = -a·tau + sqrt((a·tau)^2 + 2·a·e) already budgets the vertical-velocity loop's own lag tau = 1/gain, so a full-rate sink is stopped at the target, not below it.",
